  {
    "episode_id": 96238,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96238.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "Well, I am so grateful that you've been able to join us and I know all of rural America is so grateful for your leadership. I think there's a lot of people you read a lot about in Washington DC and then there's the people who make the trains run on time and actually get the job done and Debbie, during my time, I'm not ashamed to say I think you're among the top three legislators that I worked with because you knew how to get stuff done. And I am so grateful you're using those talents for rural America and for our ag producers.",
